text:
We're designing, developing, and growing Incogni - a privacy-tech product that helps people protect their personal data online. With Incogni, anyone can automatically remove their personal information from data brokers and other third-party companies. Join our Marketing Design team and help shape the experience for a product that's making privacy simple for everyone.




IF YOU WANT TO:

 - Design high-converting static and animated creatives for Meta and Google Ads;

 - Edit videos in both long and short form;

 - Shape storytelling and visuals from first concept to final delivery;

 - Bring ideas to life with motion graphics and animation;

 - Work with marketers to read performance data and sharpen creative based on what it tells you;

 - Partner with the Creative Strategist to turn briefs into finished ads - and bring your own take on visuals, formats, and execution;

 - Use AI tools to speed up design, editing, retouching, and variations;

 - Keep asset libraries, templates, and project files organized so the whole team moves quickly.




AND YOU CAN CHECK OFF:

 - Proven experience in graphic design, animation, and video editing for performance marketing;

 - A clear sense of how design moves the numbers that matter — CTR, CPA, and ROAS;

 - Hands-on use of AI tools in creative workflows;

 - Strong command of Adobe Creative Cloud and Figma;

 - Comfort working solo and as part of a team;

 - Clear communication, written and spoken;

 - The range to switch between styles without losing your creative edge.




HERE’S THE DEAL:

 - Growth and learning opportunities: time dedicated to learning, conferences, online learning platforms, and books for your professional development;

 - Health and wellness: we want you to feel and be your best. That's why we offer various benefits, from online workouts and a physical coach to health insurance and regular mental health checks;

 - Tools of your choice: choose the technical equipment and tools you need to do your best work;

 - Community and celebrations: get ready for long-lasting traditions such as yearly workation, Friday get-togethers, various team buildings and company celebrations;

 - Work-life balance: We encourage working in the office, with the possibility of up to two remote days per week. Plus, with our WFA policy, you can work from almost anywhere in the world;

 - More days off: additional vacation days depending on your tenure;

 - Premium Surfshark accounts: for you, your family, and friends;

 - Gross salary: 3200 - 4200 EUR/month. Although it may vary depending on your skills and experience.
